          %h2#i_the_jhomomorphism
            %strong I)
            The J-homomorphism
          %p
            The
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/J-homomorphism"} J-homomorphism
            is a map from the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+orthogonal+group"} stable orthogonal group
            (which are completely understood) to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+homotopy+groups+of+spheres"} stable homotopy groups of spheres
            (which in their totality are hard to compute).
          %h3#OnGroups On groups
          #SphereAsCompactification.num_defn
            %h6#definition Definition
            %p
