          %h2#iv_adams_spectral_sequence_for_local_homotopy_groups
            %strong IV)
            Adams spectral sequence for
            = succeed "-local" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E
          %p
            Summing up the above, we need a means to compute
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy groups
            of
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E
