              %a{:href => "#TheEAdamsSpectralSequence"}> The E-Adams-Novikov spectral sequence
              \.
          %h3#SpectralSequencesForHomotopyGroupsOfFilteredObjects Spectral sequences for homotopy groups of filtered spectra
          %p
            We discuss the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectral+sequence+of+a+filtered+stable+homotopy+type"} spectral sequence of a filtered stable homotopy type
          %p
