                    \\otimes_{E_\bullet}
                    E_\bullet(X)
                    \\,.
          %p
            Reviewed for instance as (
            %a{:href => "#Wilson13"}> Wilson 13, prop. 1.3.1
            ).
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_12 Remark
            %p
              This makes
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %msub
                      %mi E
                      %mo •
                    %mo ,
                    %msub
                      %mi E
                      %mo •
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi E
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (E_\bullet, E_\bullet(E))
              be the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commutative+Hopf+algebroid"} commutative Hopf algebroid
              formed by the
              = succeed "-" do
